            "created_at": "2025-07-22T06:06:14.78606+00:00",
            "notes": "This will be your standard flanking Reaper gameplay. You get into the backline, pick off at least one support if you can, both if the opportunity shows itself and then Wraith Form yourself back to the front.\n\nDon't forget that thanks to [Spirited to Slay](item_e11c7adb-70b7-4816-8e31-2c94c600bfd5), if you get a kill you get your cooldowns back and Wraith Form automatically reloads your weapons for you. Additionally,  [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) ups your attack speed after an elimination which helps secure the second support kill.",
