            "created_at": "2025-07-22T06:06:14.78606+00:00",
            "notes": "By now, the enemy team is becoming wise to your flanks and you targeting the backline so this is where your strategy starts to shift. Now you'll be switching between targeting the tank and targeting the supports.\n\nIf the tank is being pocketed go after the supports and put pressure on them, but don't get greedy and stay aware of your position. If your tank is having trouble fight their tank, then prioritize helping the frontline. Don't be afraid to get in the enemy tanks face since you should have either  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) or  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) for additional life steal to keep you up. \n\nJust always play for your life since at this point in the game, you should be the biggest threat on your team in terms of weapon damage and the enemy team will be looking to take you out as quickly as they can.",
