            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-22T06:06:14.78606+00:00",
            "notes": "Hopefully by this point, you've won the previous rounds and just haven't gotten the mercy rule. Here is where we secure the win. At round four, you're definitely a target priority for the enemy team and are on the top of their list for who to get out first.\n\nThis means you need to be play as safely as you can and not get greedy. Shadow Step and Wraith Form in to get to the objective and then wait for your team to engage in the fight. Their supports __WILL__ be on high alert for you and ping you as soon as they see you so wait for their backs to be turned. If you can take out a support or a low health DPS then Wraith Form back to your team and fight on the frontlines behind your tank until.\n\nIf you can't secure the kill before their team notices you then that's okay. You've at the very least distracted the frontline enough for your team to get a break or to push, and you retreat safely to your team.",
